# PostgreSQL connection URL. Replace all placeholders locally; never commit .env files.
# DATABASE_URL must use a pool that preserves connection affinity during transactions.
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://USER:PASSWORD@HOST:5432/zeus?schema=public"

# T-002 does not connect to a database. TEAM-DATA owns Prisma setup in T-003.
# Public shop timezone and currency defaults are configured in src/config/brand.ts.
# Staff authentication environment variables belong to the later auth implementation.

# --- Staff authentication (P1-06, ADR-003) ---
# Exact origin staff pages are served from; unsafe /api/admin requests must send this Origin.
APP_ORIGIN="http://localhost:3000"
# In production DATABASE_URL must also set connection_limit=32 (or more) and pool_timeout=2,
# or staff sign-in refuses to run (27 customer + 5 staff connections).
# Client identity for sign-in limits. NONE (default) ignores forwarding headers and puts every
# client in one shared bucket. PROXY_HOPS uses the address the Nth trusted proxy appended to
# X-Forwarded-For; enable it only after the ingress topology is verified (P1-10).
# TRUSTED_CLIENT_IP_MODE="NONE"
# TRUSTED_PROXY_HOPS="1"
# One-off bootstrap for `npm run staff:credential -- set-password ...` where no terminal is
# available. Set it only for that command and unset it right after. Never commit a value.
# STAFF_BOOTSTRAP_PASSWORD=
